  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation JRC contribution agreement - Planet MAAP 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: JRC contribution agreement - Planet MAAP 2025-2027 - The overall objective of the action is to support the global transition to inclusive, smart, clean, safe, secure, resilient and sustainable transport and cities in partner countries, in line with the Green Deal and the Global Gateway&#xbf;s geopolitical offer. It prepares to scale up Global Gateway, and aims at consolidating and completing INTPA&#xbf;s knowledge and investment preparation toolbox in the sustainable mobility and urban development sectors. The action includes: (i) a second phase of the Global Gateway Transport Support Mechanism and Urban Development Technical Facility to be implemented through service contract, and (ii) tapping on the knowledge and experience of specialised entities through direct grants, Contribution or Administrative Agreements. &amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
